      "title": "Developing: Woman killed as iron structure collapses during dismantling after Dahi Handi event",
      "summary": "A 45-year-old woman died after a temporary iron structure erected for a Dahi Handi celebration collapsed on her while it was being dismantled in the Old Sanghvi area on Friday night, police said on Saturday",
